{"id":"c6501493b1a4f2e7","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-termgale.md","title":"终止鞅族及其有效最优性","display":"df-termgale — 终止鞅族及其有效最优性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-termgale","aliases":["43-df-termgale"],"display":"df-termgale — 终止鞅族及其有效最优性","depends_on":["[[43-df-string]]","[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definitions 17.11.1,17.11.4–17.11.5; Lemma 17.11.2","source_printed_pages":"545–546","source_pdf_pages":"565–566","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-termgale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-termgale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-termgale — 终止鞅族及其有效最优性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc3ac987908461b8\" href=\"?note=cc3ac987908461b8\" title=\"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function\">43-df-lower-semicomputable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definitions 17.11.1,17.11.4–17.11.5; Lemma 17.11.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"545–546"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"565–566"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square\\notin\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\square\\notin\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是固定符号；二进制串和空串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_2\">\\(\\#_2\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathcal T\">\\(u\\in\\mathcal T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\square\">\\(\\sigma\\square\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|u|\">\\(|u|\\)</span> 和编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_{\\mathcal T}\">\\(\\#_{\\mathcal T}\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathcal T\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:\\mathcal T\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,E\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T})^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}\">\\(D,E\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T})^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_s=D(s)\">\\(D_s=D(s)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_s=E(s)\">\\(E_s=E(s)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LSC}_{\\mathcal T}\">\\(\\operatorname{LSC}_{\\mathcal T}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cc3ac987908461b8\" href=\"?note=cc3ac987908461b8\" title=\"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function\">43-df-lower-semicomputable-function</a>，其域编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_{\\mathcal T}\">\\(\\#_{\\mathcal T}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\square\\coloneqq\\sigma\\cup\\{(|\\sigma|,\\square)\\},\\qquad\\mathcal T\\coloneqq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\cup\\{\\sigma\\square:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma\\square\\coloneqq\\sigma\\cup\\{(|\\sigma|,\\square)\\},\\qquad\\mathcal T\\coloneqq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\cup\\{\\sigma\\square:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|u|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(u),\\qquad\\#_{\\mathcal T}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}2\\#_2(u),&amp;u\\in2^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\2\\#_2(\\{(i,u(i)):i\\in\\mathbb N\\land i&lt;|u|-1\\})+1,&amp;u\\in\\mathcal T\\setminus2^{&lt;\\omega}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|u|\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(u),\\qquad\\#_{\\mathcal T}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}2\\#_2(u),&amp;u\\in2^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\2\\#_2(\\{(i,u(i)):i\\in\\mathbb N\\land i&lt;|u|-1\\})+1,&amp;u\\in\\mathcal T\\setminus2^{&lt;\\omega}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{STermgale}(s,d)\\iff d(\\varepsilon)\\le1\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left[d(\\sigma)\\ge2^{-s}\\bigl(d(\\sigma0)+d(\\sigma1)+d(\\sigma\\square)\\bigr)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{STermgale}(s,d)\\iff d(\\varepsilon)\\le1\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left[d(\\sigma)\\ge2^{-s}\\bigl(d(\\sigma0)+d(\\sigma1)+d(\\sigma\\square)\\bigr)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Termgale}(D)\\iff\\left(\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\operatorname{STermgale}(s,D_s)\\right)\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathcal T\\;2^{-s|u|}D_s(u)=2^{-t|u|}D_t(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Termgale}(D)\\iff\\left(\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\operatorname{STermgale}(s,D_s)\\right)\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathcal T\\;2^{-s|u|}D_s(u)=2^{-t|u|}D_t(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConstructiveTermgale}(D)\\iff\\operatorname{Termgale}(D)\\land\\operatorname{LSC}_{\\mathcal T}(D_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ConstructiveTermgale}(D)\\iff\\operatorname{Termgale}(D)\\land\\operatorname{LSC}_{\\mathcal T}(D_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}(D)\\iff\\operatorname{ConstructiveTermgale}(D)\\land\\forall E\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T})^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{ConstructiveTermgale}(E)\\Rightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;D_s(\\sigma\\square)\\ge cE_s(\\sigma\\square)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}(D)\\iff\\operatorname{ConstructiveTermgale}(D)\\land\\forall E\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T})^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{ConstructiveTermgale}(E)\\Rightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;D_s(\\sigma\\square)\\ge cE_s(\\sigma\\square)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>终止符占一个位置；族间缩放也作用在终止串上，否则不能恢复后续有限串维数公式。此为 Lemma 17.11.2 的缩放关系在统一域上的展开，修正草稿 Definition 17.11.4 中漏写终止串域及 d′ 的明显符号漂移。最优性只要求在终止串上乘法支配。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Definitions 17.11.1,17.11.4–17.11.5; Lemma 17.11.2，印刷页 545–546，PDF 页 565–566。来源定位沿用附件；此次修订核查形式化与内部一致性，未重新核对原书PDF。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function","status":"resolved","id":"cc3ac987908461b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\square\\notin\\{0,1\\}$ 是固定符号；二进制串和空串 $\\varepsilon$ 见 [[43-df-string]]，$\\#_2$ 见 [[43-df-effective-coding]]。$\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}$，$u\\in\\mathcal T$；$\\mathcal T$、$\\sigma\\s