\sigma\\square$、$\\operatorname{Termgale}$、$\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}$ 见 [[43-df-termgale]]。$D,D^*\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}^{\\mathcal T})^{\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}}$，并假设 $\\operatorname{Termgale}(D)$、$\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}(D^*)$；$D^*$ 固定。$\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}$；下确界在非负扩展实数中求取，$\\inf\\varnothing=+\\infty$。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-460","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-termgale]] — 终止鞅族及其有效最优性"},{"id":"61dd587baa22cc0f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal T$、$\\operatorname{OptimalTermgale}$ 见 [[43-df-termgale]]；$\\dim_D^\\ell$、固定 $D^*$ 的 $\\dim_{\\square}$ 见 [[43-df-finite-string-dimension]]；$K$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]。所量化 $D,E$ 为 $[0,\\infty)$ 到 $[0,\\infty)^{\\mathcal T}$ 的族。"}],"outgoing":["1cb4649e6af56ba4","cc3ac987908461b8","aa33e0ea8422ba2a"]}